msgid "Recipe 3: Single-channel code often does not need a full rewrite"
msgstr "差分レシピ 3: 単一チャネルコードは大きく変えなくてよい"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:118
