#: c3f8e0e047c844f084bed23397c3becd
msgid "Recipe 5: Read Pickle sharing in terms of compatibility"
msgstr "差分レシピ 5: Pickle 共有時の互換性を見る"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:202
#: 566e8345779e44d4aad57fd6cb748978
msgid ""
"GWexpy is designed with result sharing in mind, including cases where the "
"receiver does not have GWexpy installed.   The point here is not generic "
"Pickle safety advice, but what a GWpy user can expect operationally."
msgstr ""
"GWexpy は、受け取り手が GWexpy をインストールしていない場合も含め、結果の共有を念頭に設計されています。ここで重要なのは一般的な "
"Pickle の安全性の話ではなく、GWpy ユーザーが運用上何を期待できるかという点です。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:234
#: ae39dbeb346e44528b5029d561e3c76a
msgid "Only load Pickle data from trusted sources."
msgstr "Pickle は信頼できるデータだけをロードしてください。"

