msgid "Recipe 6: Bridge to python-control"
msgstr "差分レシピ 6: python-control との橋渡し"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:244
#: 796c0447ae61455bb354d2674bbaf35c
msgid ""
"In GWpy-based code, using `control.bode()` or similar functions requires "
"manually extracting a `FrequencySeries` value as a numpy array and passing "
"it to `control.frd()`.   In GWexpy, `to_control_frd()` handles the "
"conversion in one call, removing that boilerplate."
msgstr ""
"GWpy ベースのコードでは、`control.bode()` などの関数を使うために、`FrequencySeries` の値を numpy "
"配列として手動で取り出し、`control.frd()` に渡す必要があります。GWexpy では `to_control_frd()` が 1 "
"回の呼び出しで変換を処理し、その定型コードを不要にします。"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:281
#: 5a7e52846f70414498c8c1235a7c087c
msgid ""
"you want to treat an ASD / PSD spectrum directly as a control-system FRD "
"model"
msgstr "ASD / PSD スペクトルをそのまま制御系の FRD モデルとして扱いたいとき"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:282
#: efd46eb9a10047149c2aebfcaae17256
msgid ""
"you want to skip manual numpy extraction before passing data to "
"`control.bode()` / `control.nichols()` / `control.nyquist()`"
msgstr ""
"`control.bode()` / `control.nichols()` / `control.nyquist()` に渡す前の numpy "
"配列取り出し処理を省きたいとき"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:283
#: 68fdfb8d0fda4aa3aae33159166a74f0
msgid ""
"you want to restore a processed FRD back to a `FrequencySeries` and feed it "
"into an existing plot or statistics pipeline"
msgstr "解析結果の FRD を GWexpy の `FrequencySeries` に戻して既存のプロット・統計処理パイプラインに繋げたいとき"

#: ../../../../../../home/user/gwexpy-redesign-pydata/docs_redesign/explanation/gwexpy_for_gwpy_users.md:284
#: ac93a814af0b4198bdc629dd45daa510
